{# Compact freshness index of the shared code block, rendered in the volatile
   tail near <task>. Pure data — no imperative text: proximity to the task is
   what raises the salience of already-provided files (the block's own header
   instruction sits tens of thousands of tokens earlier and is routinely
   ignored). One line per path; "current" means the full content above is the
   live file, "stale" means it was modified after the copy shown. #}
{% if rows %}
<provided_files_index>
    Already provided in full in <provided_source_files> above:
    {% for r in rows -%}
    - {{ r.path }} (revision {{ r.revision }}, {{ "stale — modified after the copy above" if r.stale else "current" }})
    {% endfor -%}
</provided_files_index>
{% endif %}
